# A declaration has more fields than the buffer of a correspondence once
# held. Model has seventy fields f00 to f69, each holding its number; Wide
# has the same seventy in the opposite order, each holding 100 and its
# number. rd reads the first, the middle and the last through a formal of
# Model. Given Model's own Structure: 0, 35 and 69. Given Wide's, whose
# fields stand at other positions: 100, 135 and 169. Entry 7.
